\fs36 \cf0 SUMMARY\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \cf0 This pipeline gathers, cleans, combines, and models earthquake-related data for the development of a New Zealand Felt RAPID intensity attenuation relationship.\
The pipeline gathers:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
the GeoNet earthquake catalogue;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
GeoNet Felt RAPID reported-intensity observations;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
GeoNet centroid moment-tensor solutions;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
GeoNet processed strong-motion observations;\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
New Zealand Vs30 site-condition estimates.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 It then:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
creates one integrated earthquake-level catalogue;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
joins Felt RAPID spatial cells to their associated earthquakes;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
calculates epicentral and hypocentral distances;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
estimates approximate finite-rupture dimensions and rupture distances;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
extracts Vs30 values at Felt RAPID reporting locations;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
assigns site-condition variables;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
fits and compares mixed-effects intensity attenuation models;\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
saves predictions, residuals, diagnostics, and model objects.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The earthquake-level catalogues contain one row per earthquake. Felt RAPID and strong-motion observations are retained as long-form datasets because each earthquake may have many reporting cells or recording stations.\
NOTE: Filtering parameters have been set restrictively due to the exponential increase in the time required to download the data as the filters are relaxed. These can be set to appropriate levels and the total required data downloaded when necessary.\cf3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf3 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa298\partightenfactor0

